sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser
    participant A as Attacker (on-path)
    participant S as Server
    Note over U,S: Without HSTS
    U->>A: HTTP request (plaintext)
    A-->>U: Strips redirect, proxies as HTTP
    Note over A: SSLStrip reads everything
    Note over U,S: With HSTS preload
    Note over U: Cached policy forces HTTPS<br/>before any packet leaves
    U->>S: HTTPS request only
    A--xU: No plaintext to intercept
